From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcp60: Implement overflow_error, underflow_error and domain_error.

msvcp60's overflow_error, underflow_error and domain_error: the
constructors from a basic_string, copy constructors, assignments,
destructors, vtables (exported data) and _Doraise (the shared FIXME of
the other msvcp60 exception classes), as the msvcp90 sources build
range_error. Also maps ARM names whose i386 twins are implemented.
