 dlls/msvcp60/msvcp60.spec | 158 +++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------------
 dlls/msvcp90/exception.c  | 123 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 198 insertions(+), 83 deletions(-)

